{% comment %}
首光 shouguang：页眉一条 2px 墨线，线上左品牌右眉题；主标题横排宋体 200（小红书 display 档，方形 title 档），朱笔下划线只划后半句；副题 ink-2；底部留白。
朱色：仅下划线。按 title 5+4 字设计：标题宽度按 5 字折两行，划线宽 4 字（公众号封面单行，划线移到后 4 字）。
{% endcomment %}
<style>
  :scope {
    box-sizing: border-box;
    position: relative;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    padding: var(--ds-space-7) var(--ds-space-6) var(--ds-space-8);
    overflow: hidden;
    background: var(--ds-color-paper);
    color: var(--ds-color-ink);
    font-family: var(--ds-font-body);
  }
  :scope::after {
    content: "";
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    pointer-events: none;
    mix-blend-mode: multiply;
    opacity: .45;
    background-image: url("data:image/svg+xml;utf8,<svg xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' width='240' height='240'><filter id='n'><feTurbulence type='fractalNoise' baseFrequency='.85' numOctaves='3' stitchTiles='stitch'/><feColorMatrix values='0 0 0 0 .30 0 0 0 0 .24 0 0 0 0 .17 0 0 0 .16 0'/></filter><rect width='100%25' height='100%25' filter='url(%23n)'/></svg>");
  }
  .head {
    display: flex;
    align-items: baseline;
    justify-content: space-between;
    padding-bottom: var(--ds-space-3);
    border-bottom: 2px solid var(--ds-color-ink);
    font-size: var(--ds-type-caption);
    letter-spacing: .16em;
  }
  .brand {
    margin: 0;
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  .kicker {
    margin: 0;
    font-weight: 400;
    color: var(--ds-color-ink-2);
  }
  .main {
    margin-top: var(--ds-space-10);
  }
  .hl {
    position: relative;
    width: 5.2em;
    font-size: var(--ds-type-display);
  }
  .title {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: inherit;
    font-weight: 200;
    letter-spacing: -.01em;
    line-height: 1.16;
  }
  .stroke {
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    bottom: -.06em;
    width: 4em;
    height: 30px;
    overflow: visible;
    fill: var(--ds-color-zhu);
  }
  .subtitle {
    margin: var(--ds-space-8) 0 0;
    font-size: var(--ds-type-lead);
    font-weight: 400;
    letter-spacing: .04em;
    line-height: 1.5;
    color: var(--ds-color-ink-2);
  }
  .kicker:has(> :empty), .subtitle:has(> :empty) { visibility: hidden; }
  @media (min-aspect-ratio: 9/10) and (max-aspect-ratio: 11/10) {
    .main { margin-top: var(--ds-space-9); }
    .hl { font-size: var(--ds-type-title); }
    .stroke { height: 22px; }
    .subtitle { margin-top: var(--ds-space-7); }
  }
  @media (min-aspect-ratio: 2/1) {
    :scope { padding: var(--ds-space-5) var(--ds-space-7) var(--ds-space-6); }
    .main { margin-top: auto; }
    .hl { width: auto; font-size: var(--ds-type-head); }
    .title { letter-spacing: .02em; line-height: 1.25; }
    .stroke { left: 5.14em; bottom: -.04em; width: 4.1em; height: 18px; }
    .subtitle { margin-top: var(--ds-space-4); font-size: var(--ds-type-note); letter-spacing: .06em; }
  }
</style>
<div class="head">
  <p class="brand">{{ slots.brand }}</p>
  <p class="kicker">{{ slots.kicker }}</p>
</div>
<div class="main">
  <div class="hl">
    <h1 class="title">{{ slots.title }}</h1>
    <svg class="stroke" viewBox="0 0 400 24" preserveAspectRatio="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M2 14C60 8 140 10 214 8S340 8 398 10C344 14 270 17 204 16S70 19 2 14Z"/></svg>
  </div>
  <p class="subtitle">{{ slots.subtitle }}</p>
</div>
